WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-reelshort-6a3f6465934d3e8b110840c2 — Episode 49 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-28 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:02.180
I thought we were going to get married.

2
00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:05.180
But you've never loved me, have you?

3
00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:06.180
I'm not stupid.

4
00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:09.180
I can tell who you love.

5
00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:12.180
I'm here to call off the engagement myself.

6
00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:15.180
As your former fiance, let me warn you both.

7
00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:19.180
Even if Uncle Arthur is a murderer, he's still Evelyn's fiance.

8
00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:21.550
You too.

9
00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:23.550
Never mind.

10
00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:32.080
Vincent, we can't.

11
00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:37.730
I was your father's fiance.

12
00:00:37.730 --> 00:00:38.730
Our status...

13
00:00:38.730 --> 00:00:40.730
I don't care.

14
00:00:40.730 --> 00:00:41.730
I do.

15
00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:44.730
What would Isidara think?

16
00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:46.730
She entrusted you to me, yet I...

17
00:00:46.730 --> 00:00:49.730
Mom would want you to be happy.

18
00:00:49.730 --> 00:00:50.730
This outfit is ridiculous.

19
00:00:50.730 --> 00:00:52.730
Can I skip this stupid graduation ceremony?

20
00:00:52.730 --> 00:00:54.730
I already have the shares anyway.

21
00:00:57.040 --> 00:00:58.040
No.

22
00:00:58.040 --> 00:01:01.040
This is the day Isabona looked forward to the most.

23
00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:03.040
You must stand in the light with dignity.

24
00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:06.040
I'll head to the cemetery later,

25
00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:09.040
leave these flowers for Isidora and tell her the good news.

26
00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:13.040
Then I'll go straight to the auditorium to watch your graduation speech.

27
00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:16.410
Come back soon.

28
00:01:16.410 --> 00:01:19.410
I won't go on stage if you're not in the audience.
